"(Transporter Classification Database) by UniProt accession. Returns TC "
"classification number(s), family description, associated PDB structures, "
"and human gene info if applicable. TC# format: "
"class.subclass.family.subfamily.protein (e.g., 2.A.1.1.28 for human "
"GLUT1)."
